hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"104","اللّهُـمَّ قِنـي عَذابَـكَ يَـوْمَ تَبْـعَثُ عِبـادَك .","","","","","For one afflicted by a calamity"
"105","بِاسْـمِكَ اللّهُـمَّ أَمـوتُ وَأَحْـيا","","","","","For one afflicted by a calamity"
